 I'd be happy to help you resolve CORS (Cross-Origin Resource Sharing) errors in your Next.js application that is fetching data from a WordPress REST API. CORS errors occur when a web application tries to access resources from another domain, protocol, or port, and the server refuses the request due to security reasons. Here are some steps you can take to fix this issue:

